# World 1, ring 0: the crash site, where the robot starts. Baked from the seed-1 world, then
# raised into a grass plateau with a rocky rise: it meets the sea in cliffs to the east and
# south-east, and steps down to beaches on the other sides, where a dock can go. The plateau
# is too high to climb straight onto (HexPathfinder.MAX_CLIMB), so a terrace halfway down (the
# 2s) leads to the beaches on the north, west and south-west. Pines and leaf trees grow in the
# woods east of the wreck, and palms at the ends of the beaches.
